[63.270784, "o", "-iwad\r\n-iwad not specified, trying a few iwad names\r\nunknown.wad\r\nplutonia.wad\r\ntnt.wad\r\ndoom.wad\r\nchex.wad\r\nhacx.wad\r\nfreedm.wad\r\nfreedoom2.wad\r\nfreedoom1.wad\r\nheretic.wad\r\nheretic1.wad\r\nhexen.wad\r\nstrife1.wad\r\nFREEDOOM\r\nThe Ultimate DOOM\r\nDOOM Registered\r\nDOOM Shareware\r\nDOOM 2: Hell on Earth\r\nDOOM 2: Plutonia Experiment\r\nDOOM 2: TNT - Evilution\r\nspecifying one with the '-iwad' command line parameter.\r\nR_Init: Init DOOM refresh daemon - \r\nENDOOM\r\nTo continue the DOOM experience, play\r\nDOOM! -- Inferno.\r\nA hidden doorway opens and you enter.\r\nnowadays..\r\nThe vista opening ahead looks real damn\r\nDOOM%02i.%s\r\nFailed to open either '%s' or '%s' to write savegame.\r\nFailed to open savegame file '%s' for writing.\r\nlevel 6: open season\r\n/usr/bin/zenity --help >/dev/null 2>&1\r\nM_DOOM\r\nM_Episode: 4th episode requires UltimateDOOM\r\nYou need a blue key to open this door\r\nYou need a yellow key to open this door\r\nYou need a red key to open this door\r\nsaveg_write8: Error while writing save game\r\nR_DrawPlanes: opening over"]
